#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:6
msgid "First Example: Blinky (LED Blinking)"
msgstr "首个示例：Blinky（LED 闪烁）"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:8
msgid ""
"This document details how to compile, flash, and run the first UniSDK "
"example program — the GPIO demo (Blinky LED blinking)."
msgstr ""
"本文档详细介绍如何编译、烧录并运行第一个 UniSDK 示例程序——GPIO 演示（Blinky LED 闪烁）。"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:10
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:12
msgid "[Environment setup](../getting_started/index.md) is complete"
msgstr "[环境搭建](../getting_started/index.md)已完成"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:13
msgid "Toolchain `TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH` is configured"
msgstr "工具链 `TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH` 已配置"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:14
msgid ""
"You have a Telink development board on hand (this example uses "
"TLSR9528A_EVK)"
msgstr "手头有一块 Telink 开发板（本示例使用 TLSR9528A_EVK）"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:16
msgid "Example Overview"
msgstr "示例概述"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:18
msgid ""
"The `gpio_demo` example demonstrates basic GPIO input/output "
"functionality and interrupt handling:"
msgstr ""
"`gpio_demo` 示例演示了基本的 GPIO 输入/输出功能和中断处理："

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:20
msgid ""
"Configures a GPIO pin as output mode, periodically toggling to achieve "
"LED blinking"
msgstr "将 GPIO 引脚配置为输出模式，周期性翻转以实现 LED 闪烁"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:21
msgid "Configures interrupt handling to respond to button input"
msgstr "配置中断处理以响应按键输入"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:22
msgid "Demonstrates the use of sleep APIs"
msgstr "演示睡眠 API 的使用"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:24
msgid "Source code location: `samples/gpio_demo/main.c`"
msgstr "源代码位置：`samples/gpio_demo/main.c`"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:26
msgid "Step 1: Configure Chip Type"
msgstr "步骤 1：配置芯片类型"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:36
msgid ""
"!!! tip \"Available Chips and Boards\"     List all supported options:"
"     ```bash     west tl-socs      # View all chips     west tl-boards"
"    # View all boards     ```"
msgstr ""
"!!! tip \"可用芯片与开发板\"     列出所有支持的选项：     ```bash     west tl-socs      # 查看所有芯片     west tl-boards    "
" # 查看所有开发板     ```"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:43
msgid "Step 2: Compilation"
msgstr "步骤 2：编译"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:53
msgid ""
"After a successful build, the output files are located in the `build/` "
"directory:"
msgstr "构建成功后，输出文件位于 `build/` 目录中："

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md
msgid "Build Output Files"
msgstr "构建输出文件"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:66
msgid "Step 3: Flashing"
msgstr "步骤 3：烧录"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:76
msgid "Step 4: Verification"
msgstr "步骤 4：验证"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:78
msgid ""
"After flashing is complete, the LED on the development board will blink "
"at a fixed frequency, indicating that the program is running normally."
msgstr "烧录完成后，开发板上的 LED 将以固定频率闪烁，表示程序正常运行。"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:80
msgid "Custom Modifications"
msgstr "自定义修改"

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:82
msgid ""
"Open `samples/gpio_demo/main.c` to modify parameters such as the LED "
"blinking frequency:"
msgstr "打开 `samples/gpio_demo/main.c` 修改参数，例如 LED 闪烁频率："

#: ../../source/developing/blinky.md:89
msgid "After making changes, recompile and flash:"
msgstr "修改后，重新编译并烧录："

